/target
**/*.rs.bk
Cargo.lock.bak
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
.DS_Store
/results/
/out/
/tmp/
/.cargo/config.toml
*.summary.tsv
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Generated demux output from real datasets. Keep only the small machine-readable
# records under benchmarks/ (benchmark_results.tsv, provenance/, commands.log,
# i464_metadata.tsv). Real FASTQ must never enter git.
#
# The trailing slash matters on the gate rule: the correctness-gate *directories*
# are throwaway FULL output, but the gate *result files* under provenance/ are
# cited evidence and must stay tracked.
benchmarks/**/runs*/
benchmarks/**/gate_*/
benchmarks/**/binaries/
*.fq.gz
*.fastq.gz

# Archived production-regression evidence for M17 is deliberately tracked even
# though it contains per-run summaries.
!benchmarks/m17_regression/**

# Internal development and release documents
NOTICE.md
DEVELOPMENT_PLAN.md
CHANGELOG.md

